<h2>Check WCAG color contrast</h2><p class="lead">Enter foreground and background hex colors to calculate the relative-luminance contrast ratio and text thresholds.</p>
<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="fg">Foreground</label><input id="fg" type="text" value="#1f2937" maxlength="7"></div><div class="field"><label for="bg">Background</label><input id="bg" type="text" value="#ffffff" maxlength="7"></div></div>
